[{"key":"0mau5du1ukr30a","text":"Every move captures one of your own pieces. Each piece gets 2 captures. Kings are never captured."},{"key":"1vo4h6d0obzuet","text":"The bishop lives on dark squares, but the star is on a light square. Never!"},{"key":"1k1ldlc1ryp88e","text":"Stalemate: the king can't move, but he's NOT in check. That's a tie!"},{"key":"0jqa5ks10x0u4a","text":"Black's pawn just jumped two steps! Catch it with the sneaky trick."},{"key":"18eb47p0pt9m5b","text":"The bishop attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"1lziszb021ybxf","text":"The king attacks the king. That's check! He can still get away."},{"key":"1qsrww81u501gy","text":"The knight attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"0w929ta0imoipi","text":"The king attacks the king and he can't escape. Checkmate!"},{"key":"10yytf30kpd939","text":"Chess board: tap every piece that can capture the cookie"},{"key":"0acaajt0p7vr49","text":"You kept trying, even when it was tricky. That is brave!"},{"key":"1ortn7114r0bwv","text":"Bruno found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"1qbnw3o0yteyms","text":"Fern found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"0rfovco0h6dg1c","text":"Hop found this checkmate. Let's remember that trick!"},{"key":"1ol59vy1awfb3w","text":"Just one rook and your king. Squeeze and checkmate!"},{"key":"1hhpis30higamv","text":"Set up the back row! Tap a piece, then its square."},{"key":"00r03gl05fkhz9","text":"Oops, Bruno left a bishop alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0mmdi3o0gk6oik","text":"What does the bishop want? Keep your knight safe!"},{"key":"0ytnzv81vxg2uu","text":"Oops, Tuck left a bishop alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0nm1yzu0wh21su","text":"Oops, Bruno left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1djjxtz1ny82yh","text":"There! Next time you can do it all by yourself!"},{"key":"14l7ggl00u0cn7","text":"Oops, Fern left a queen alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1394rsx1fli3ff","text":"Oops, Bruno left a rook alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"1tdw27m1877doy","text":"The queen gives check, but the king can escape."},{"key":"17hjhyd162qlot","text":"What does the pawn want? Keep your bishop safe!"},{"key":"1xqndf60p1ge62","text":"Oops, Tuck left a king alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"0df5iy71yr5f8b","text":"Oops, Fern left a pawn alone! Can you find it?"},{"key":"172sy5h1wz6ngl","text":"Watch me! Check, and the rook is attacked too."},{"key":"0bvq44l17q7oil","text":"Friends block the road. Enemies can be eaten!"},{"key":"08duwb20axrd1o","text":"Your turn! Tap every square the pawn can go."},{"key":"1u20jnd1wjh6wh","text":"Shelly's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"0lgcq9q1eoqhba","text":"Lots of moves and no captures. It's a tie!"},{"key":"05axs6d0ukquu7","text":"Olive's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"04fvyij08w2r6t","text":"Two steps and a turn. Try every direction!"},{"key":"0qd0wks18z9r1i","text":"Stop showing Pip? You can try again later."},{"key":"0jx8pnn182gk77","text":"Your first check! The king felt the lava."},{"key":"1vnsva10hca4br","text":"Hop's mating move. Remember the pattern."},{"key":"1g93kbu18x7az0","text":"Look at the path between king and rook."},{"key":"09160ub0rntjgr","text":"Chess board: tap the piece giving check"},{"key":"08ncuvq07qgb50","text":"First the letter a, then the number 2."},{"key":"00bfbkn07qgb9l","text":"First the letter a, then the number 7."},{"key":"0dsm5sx0u81nhj","text":"First the letter b, then the number 4."},{"key":"1mjsbd31gpmzph","text":"First the letter c, then the number 1."},{"key":"0mhpyac1gpmzu2","text":"First the letter c, then the number 6."},{"key":"1hln89w0464a2w","text":"First the letter d, then the number 3."},{"key":"1i6aprf0464a7h","text":"First the letter d, then the number 8."},{"key":"1tcui0h0qnpmff","text":"First the letter e, then the number 5."},{"key":"1q6ok9n1d5aynd","text":"First the letter f, then the number 2."},{"key":"0q3ogle1d5ayry","text":"First the letter f, then the number 7."},{"key":"0aun8qa00ls90s","text":"First the letter g, then the number 4."},{"key":"0exuvtm0n3dl8q","text":"First the letter h, then the number 1."},{"key":"0fiidb50n3dldb","text":"First the letter h, then the number 6."},{"key":"1y8qn3y01zhs2e","text":"A knight in the corner. How many hops?"},{"key":"19f5ha509r85bb","text":"You win 13, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"0v40oge16dsdsw","text":"Yes! That rook is attacking the king!"},{"key":"0g83ter0f62681","text":"You found that way! Try another one."},{"key":"18obijo0kui9bk","text":"Olive made a queen first. Try again!"},{"key":"09nhydz1hzz6j9","text":"You win 2, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"1mvfwv60m3qpq2","text":"You win 7, and nobody can take back!"},{"key":"0dhjapv1eh0wk9","text":"Yes, check! Now tap who's attacking!"},{"key":"0767w4t0k05dy9","text":"That one is dark. Find a light one!"},{"key":"0k4yro6179528c","text":"That's the knight! Find the knight."},{"key":"1wvgjyg1ldwr26","text":"Can you capture something for free?"},{"key":"151u9wj1cs31a7","text":"A fork attacks two targets at once."},{"key":"1xsb0f913rnl2d","text":"That's the knight! Find the queen."},{"key":"0y20meu12a2b0g","text":"Is the king attacked? Can he move?"},{"key":"0brnnav1lswp4b","text":"We'll come back to this one later!"},{"key":"1pcjopa0pumhxa","text":"That's the queen! Find the queen."},{"key":"10n2ndf1gejx4t","text":"That's the bishop! Find the pawn."},{"key":"127084x0eqwq1p","text":"That's the pawn! Find the knight."},{"key":"0hbcuue15obme8","text":"That piece would hang. Try again."},{"key":"18alj5w1ebzijq","text":"Tap every square the pawn can go!"},{"key":"0oavvdg0ax7jx2","text":"That's the pawn! Find the queen."},{"key":"0m2og1319iliar","text":"Shelly won this time. Good game!"},{"key":"1shwnmy0vd8ap6","text":"You castled your king to safety!"},{"key":"19295z91optgox","text":"That's the king! Find the pawn."},{"key":"10waqi31dpnoyp","text":"That's the pawn! Find the king."},{"key":"1544obv0e222hp","text":"Capture the Crown. rook's turn."},{"key":"1uz4qal1ovlqmv","text":"Checkmate in 12 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0txzc481lk1od4","text":"Bruno won this time. Good game!"},{"key":"1xbrp6d00r65yl","text":"You played chess with a friend!"},{"key":"1iwz7vp0qw4z1f","text":"Put each piece on its outline!"},{"key":"1yjf4x00y09siw","text":"Checkmate in 4 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"0sjrvan0on7hd9","text":"Checkmate in 9 moves! Amazing!"},{"key":"1b0djkw11vvoje","text":"Now the whole army, pawns too!"},{"key":"02urhtj1cnm8gd","text":"That is stalemate. Try again."},{"key":"0zf2mae1639ebq","text":"Is this capture a good trade?"},{"key":"1rap5bh128c8gl","text":"Pawn war board. king's turn."},{"key":"1qk1uwk1agb3s2","text":"Pawn war board. pawn's turn."},{"key":"0twttjo1ykqge4","text":"Every move must eat a snack!"},{"key":"0uyxshy0502vrg","text":"Only 12! You found them all!"},{"key":"033qcpw0h7wiqm","text":"Knight fork: king and queen."},{"key":"08ypbjl1aimgqh","text":"Only 0! You found them all!"},{"key":"0i1uy0g1rjkz1a","text":"Only 5! You found them all!"},{"key":"0mcnb620g8evjq","text":"Checkmate! You beat Shelly!"},{"key":"0vq1hq40o3zuh6","text":"Ladder mate with two rooks."},{"key":"1jye1ts09cghkq","text":"Where is the rook? Tap it!"},{"key":"0i8nrd20js8cm6","text":"11 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"1anasnu00w2a2m","text":"The queen was guarding it!"},{"key":"1s17m70004wvd0","text":"Checkmate! You beat Olive!"},{"key":"0q61t3w1kurnc2","text":"Right, you can't! Why not?"},{"key":"032y6ne1l5u5t8","text":"I know how the pieces move"},{"key":"0qthgo31gt5z3n","text":"7 squares! Great dashing!"},{"key":"1ni7xbi0msy71y","text":"The pawn was guarding it!"},{"key":"01lz03m06a44y8","text":"Checkmate! You beat Fern!"},{"key":"0r82oay17bdbjc","text":"Checkmate, not stalemate!"},{"key":"0x5xykk0dc7fve","text":"The king is guarding it!"},{"key":"05e1eb902fetd3","text":"The pawn is guarding it!"},{"key":"193f10w0cj8l6w","text":"Tuck made a queen first."},{"key":"0qsq8az1f7mtw7","text":"Where can the king step?"},{"key":"1mtbbcd05tpll5","text":"Yes! That's the bishop!"},{"key":"11ed0091mms2av","text":"12 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"0zz7o1b18wbxut","text":"Here is the whole trip!"},{"key":"16706qf16mz3k9","text":"Try moving your bishop!"},{"key":"0wfidv50p4hv25","text":"Castle to the big side!"},{"key":"0z0j8b20651fic","text":"Also mutes piece sounds"},{"key":"1au76kh04unbg7","text":"3 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"06yksxu0lvltr0","text":"8 squares! A new best!"},{"key":"0op342x024e6u5","text":"Checkmate in 13 moves."},{"key":"14ddp1x1va9t3t","text":"Yes! The knight moved!"},{"key":"1ckueml16i545h","text":"Ouch, lava! Try again!"},{"key":"0ut999b1gyc5a5","text":"Tap only (no dragging)"},{"key":"0jf3o0p1bjnskf","text":"Yes! That's the rook!"},{"key":"1s73kj11qoqigb","text":"Checkmate in 2 moves."},{"key":"081kbqg0zaph00","text":"Checkmate in 7 moves."},{"key":"089b5sf05u2pi7","text":"Try moving your rook!"},{"key":"1ewiq1k119fcbk","text":"Follow the red arrow!"},{"key":"0p0td8j1qve6ft","text":"Hi pawn! Tap to play."},{"key":"0abn3ve1bjr9uy","text":"The box got smaller!"},{"key":"08009fx1ty7rsf","text":"Yes! The rook moved!"},{"key":"1vp3ym609sizms","text":"Castle the long way!"},{"key":"1qhl3jq177jrve","text":"Tap 4 light squares"},{"key":"140pist1kmycv3","text":"Tap 9 light squares"},{"key":"1dpyvst1gny379","text":"Tap 14 dark squares"},{"key":"1g166pc1tm26nw","text":"Here is the b road."},{"key":"1u3vc5j0ucda0x","text":"Here is the g road."},{"key":"0wrykvq0g0yvb4","text":"Olive won this one."},{"key":"0lb04xg01yc0q0","text":"Want an easier one?"},{"key":"1sdmc8v0wv6tup","text":"Tap 1 dark squares"},{"key":"1ukh9660b5ljt0","text":"Tap 4 dark squares"},{"key":"1u1j3hz0mbosdl","text":"Tap 9 dark squares"},{"key":"0054h8f0wobufz","text":"The king was here!"},{"key":"022xyqq0lgaplk","text":"Tuck won this one."},{"key":"0kwjit31lf3gkf","text":"Left-handed layout"},{"key":"057ntmq0fvjrns","text":"Hop won this one."},{"key":"0h5qnko0822wui","text":"En Passant 